    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The fire... it's almost peaceful in a way. Like it's the only thing that won't judge me for what I've lost. But there's still the thought of eventually being dragged out, bound in chains, paraded like some broken animal. Is there even a way to go out with some shred of dignity left, or is all I am just waiting to be humiliated?",
